Adobe-Japan1-UCS2 (CID to Unicode mapping)

`scripts/fetch_japan1.sh` fetches the mapping resource as published by Adobe
(https://github.com/adobe-type-tools/mapping-resources-pdf), version 10.002,
pinned by commit and by sha256, into `data/`. `build.rs` turns it into the
lookup table compiled into `src/japan1.rs`, which recovers Unicode text from
PDFs whose CID fonts carry no ToUnicode CMap. That table ships in the binary.

